From 09184d29fa0f4c1617336cf18386a89f19392a6e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:57:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Phase 3 (part): leave policy, balance checks, in-app and
 email notices

- leave_policy and notification tables (migration 0005)
- yearly allowance per leave type, balance shown on /leave and enforced on request
- notify() helper: in-app notification plus optional email, never blocks the action
- leave requests notify the approver; decisions notify the employee
- /leave/policy for admin and HR, /notifications with unread count in the nav
- tests for balance maths, templates, permission and the new tables
